    {
      "LogName": "Bentley's bedroom (3.13.18): the double bed is solid (headboard, pillows and footboard) except the middle mattress row (row 5, tiles 9-11), which is walkable from the two open sides so Bentley (and the player) can get into the bed. The tilesheet already marks those three tiles Passable; this repeats it on the placed tiles as a safety net.",
