      "Target": "Maps/{{ModId}}_FastFoodInterior",
      "AddNpcWarps": [
        "24 4 {{ModId}}_BentleysBedroom 7 9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "LogName": "Staff door (3.13.7): the two bottom door tiles (22,3 and 23,3) were walkable, so the player could stand on the door. They are now solid (door art copied onto the Buildings layer) and carry a vanilla Action Warp: stand in front of the door (22-23,4), then tap / click / press the action button to go into Bentley's bedroom. No touch warps any more.",
      "Action": "EditMap",
      "Target": "Maps/{{ModId}}_FastFoodInterior",
